      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manzanita%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Manzanita was platted as a beach resort in 1912, with a post office established two years later.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
