        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manzanita%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Rumors of buried treasure on Neahkahnie Mountain stem from the disappearance of the Santo Cristo de Burgos in 1693.",
